{
  "configById": {
    "Indicator!hpstate": {
      "path": "/rhody/data/bag_recorder/logging_on.data",
      "style": "background",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "rules": [
        {
          "operator": "=",
          "rawValue": "true",
          "color": "#2ca02c",
          "label": "RECORDING"
        }
      ],
      "fallbackColor": "#c77700",
      "fallbackLabel": "NOT RECORDING",
      "foxglovePanelTitle": "Recorder state"
    },
    "Indicator!hpcmd": {
      "path": "/rhody/data/logging_on.data",
      "style": "background",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "rules": [
        {
          "operator": "=",
          "rawValue": "true",
          "color": "#1f77b4",
          "label": "ON requested"
        }
      ],
      "fallbackColor": "#666666",
      "fallbackLabel": "OFF / no command",
      "foxglovePanelTitle": "Commanded (logging_on)"
    },
    "Publish!hpstart": {
      "topicName": "/rhody/data/logging_on",
      "datatype": "std_msgs/msg/Bool",
      "buttonText": "Start logging",
      "buttonTooltip": "Latch true on /rhody/data/logging_on",
      "buttonColor": "#2ca02c",
      "advancedView": false,
      "value": "{\n  \"data\": true\n}",
      "foxglovePanelTitle": "Start logging"
    },
    "Publish!hpstop": {
      "topicName": "/rhody/data/logging_on",
      "datatype": "std_msgs/msg/Bool",
      "buttonText": "Stop logging",
      "buttonTooltip": "Latch false on /rhody/data/logging_on (closes and flushes the bag)",
      "buttonColor": "#d62728",
      "advancedView": false,
      "value": "{\n  \"data\": false\n}",
      "foxglovePanelTitle": "Stop logging"
    },
    "StateTransitions!hptimeline": {
      "paths": [
        {
          "value": "/rhody/data/bag_recorder/logging_on.data",
          "label": "recording",
          "enabled": true,
          "timestampMethod": "receiveTime"
        },
        {
          "value": "/rhody/data/logging_on.data",
          "label": "commanded",
          "enabled": true,
          "timestampMethod": "receiveTime"
        }
      ],
      "isSynced": true,
      "timeWindowMode": "automatic",
      "showPoints": true,
      "foxglovePanelTitle": "Logging on/off timeline"
    },
    "DiagnosticStatusPanel!hpdiag": {
      "topicToRender": "/diagnostics",
      "selectedHardwareId": "mcap_logger",
      "selectedName": "MCAP Logger",
      "splitFraction": 0.5,
      "secondsUntilStale": 5,
      "foxglovePanelTitle": "MCAP Logger status"
    },
    "DiagnosticSummary!hpsummary": {
      "topicToRender": "/diagnostics",
      "minLevel": 0,
      "hardwareIdFilter": "",
      "sortByLevel": true,
      "secondsUntilStale": 5,
      "pinnedIds": [
        "|mcap_logger|MCAP Logger|"
      ],
      "foxglovePanelTitle": "All diagnostics (what is being recorded)"
    },
    "RosOut!hplog": {
      "topicToRender": "/rosout",
      "minLogLevel": 2,
      "searchTerms": [],
      "nameFilter": {
        "rhody.data.bag_recorder": {
          "visible": true
        },
        "bag_recorder_inner": {
          "visible": true
        },
        "foxglove_bridge": {
          "visible": false
        },
        "rhody.perception.sensors.voyis.voyis_discovery": {
          "visible": false
        }
      },
      "showLevel": true,
      "showDate": false,
      "showTime": true,
      "showTimezone": false,
      "showName": true,
      "showSourceLocation": false,
      "foxglovePanelTitle": "Recorder log"
    },
    "Parameters!hpparams": {
      "foxglovePanelTitle": "Parameters (/rhody/data/bag_recorder)"
    },
    "Markdown!hpnotes": {
      "renderMode": "static",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "markdown": "### hydroport bag recorder\n\nService `rhody-hydroport.service` (user unit) runs `hydroport/bag_recorder` as `/rhody/data/bag_recorder`. It starts **idle** and records nothing until `true` is latched on `/rhody/data/logging_on`.\n\n- **Bags:** `~/data/rhody_mcap/rhody_<UTC stamp>/`, mcap + zstd_fast, split every 900 s\n- **Records:** every topic except `/__*` and `/parameter_events`\n- **Recorder state** green = a bag is open. Commanded ON while state stays amber = settings error; read *MCAP Logger status* (ERROR names the bad directory / prefix).\n- **Live changes:** set `logging.directory`, `logging.file_prefix`, `topic_ignore_regex`, `max_bag_duration_seconds` in the Parameters panel; the recorder restarts onto a new bag if logging is commanded on.\n\nShell equivalent:\n\n```\nros2 topic pub --once --qos-durability transient_local --qos-reliability reliable /rhody/data/logging_on std_msgs/msg/Bool \"{data: true}\"\n```",
      "foxglovePanelTitle": "Notes"
    }
  },
  "globalVariables": {},
  "userNodes": {},
  "playbackConfig": {
    "speed": 1
  },
  "layout": {
    "direction": "column",
    "splitPercentage": 20,
    "first": {
      "direction": "row",
      "splitPercentage": 60,
      "first": {
        "direction": "row",
        "splitPercentage": 55,
        "first": "Indicator!hpstate",
        "second": "Indicator!hpcmd"
      },
      "second": {
        "direction": "row",
        "splitPercentage": 50,
        "first": "Publish!hpstart",
        "second": "Publish!hpstop"
      }
    },
    "second": {
      "direction": "column",
      "splitPercentage": 18,
      "first": "StateTransitions!hptimeline",
      "second": {
        "direction": "row",
        "splitPercentage": 40,
        "first": {
          "direction": "column",
          "splitPercentage": 45,
          "first": "DiagnosticStatusPanel!hpdiag",
          "second": "DiagnosticSummary!hpsummary"
        },
        "second": {
          "direction": "column",
          "splitPercentage": 50,
          "first": "RosOut!hplog",
          "second": {
            "direction": "row",
            "splitPercentage": 55,
            "first": "Parameters!hpparams",
            "second": "Markdown!hpnotes"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
